00:04:15.321 --> 00:04:18.224
♪ Waiting to move on ♪

00:04:18.224 --> 00:04:20.893
♪ And in the end ♪

00:04:20.893 --> 00:04:22.595
♪ We accept it ♪

00:04:22.595 --> 00:04:23.930 line:0%
♪♪

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:27.199
♪ We shake hands with our fate ♪

00:04:27.199 --> 00:04:30.770
♪ And we walk past ♪

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:33.539
♪ There's no rest for us
in this world ♪

00:04:33.539 --> 00:04:36.008
♪♪

00:04:36.008 --> 00:04:38.377
♪ Finally a lost love ♪

00:04:38.377 --> 00:04:40.746
-Yes! That's what
I'm talking about!

00:04:40.746 --> 00:04:42.982
More with Madonna
after the break!

